00:59:53,243 --> 00:59:57,740
which I'm struggling with and thought I'd ask you for your opinion on it.

914
01:00:03,880 --> 01:00:07,800
and he speaks with his head held high.

915
01:00:09,880 --> 01:00:10,800
Okay, sorry.

916
01:00:10,880 --> 01:00:14,800
They go for fancy outings, club nights, and recently even planned a road trip.

917
01:00:14,880 --> 01:00:16,800
Of course, I wanted to go with them.

918
01:00:16,880 --> 01:00:19,800
It would be fun, plus I'd feel more part of the group.

919
01:00:19,880 --> 01:00:21,800
I can't afford that much.

920
01:00:21,880 --> 01:00:27,800
Not only am I living hand to mouth here, but I also send money back home to support my family.

921
01:00:27,880 --> 01:00:29,800
It gets tough, brother.

922
01:00:29,880 --> 01:00:31,590
So every time I make excuses.

923
01:00:31,670 --> 01:00:37,310
to avoid spending on stuff like fancy outings.

924
01:00:37,390 --> 01:00:43,390
The problem is that now they're taking it the wrong way, like I don't enjoy hanging out with them or that I'm avoiding them.

925
01:00:43,470 --> 01:00:48,870
They think maybe I don't like hanging out with them, but reality is just my financial constraints.

926
01:00:48,950 --> 01:00:51,790
Now I feel really bad that they're misunderstanding.

927
01:00:51,870 --> 01:00:56,470
I want to stay with them, but I can't afford to. What can I do?

928
01:00:56,550 --> 01:00:58,430
How do I explain this to them without looking like I'm making it?

929
01:00:58,510 --> 01:01:03,070
I'm making them feel guilty or awkward. If you could share any advice, it'd mean a lot.

930
01:01:03,150 --> 01:01:06,750
Thank you very much and waiting to hear back from you very soon.

931
01:01:06,830 --> 01:01:09,830
So he's a brother from Punjab, Indian Punjab.

932
01:01:14,140 --> 01:01:23,240
They have friends in Canada and they are well off so they get awkward and can't afford to send money back.

933
01:01:23,320 --> 01:01:31,080
So our friend Karan and he says that only two people go out of South Asia.

934
01:01:31,160 --> 01:01:35,080
Either rich kids enjoy or poor kids earn.

935
01:01:35,160 --> 01:01:37,480
So you have to be very careful who you hang out with.

936
01:01:37,560 --> 01:01:40,980
Okay, I give this advice to people here as well.

937
01:01:42,450 --> 01:01:44,370
Couple of examples in front of me.

938
01:01:44,450 --> 01:01:48,370
Those who are on a certain level but their friends are very rich.

939
01:01:48,450 --> 01:01:51,370
So what happens is you start mirroring them.

940
01:01:51,450 --> 01:01:56,370
Then you try to match up.

941
01:01:56,450 --> 01:02:00,370
Now in matching up, you become zero.

942
01:02:00,450 --> 01:02:03,370
The next generation will tire you out.

943
01:02:03,450 --> 01:02:05,370
Okay, they don't even want you to compete with them.

944
01:02:05,450 --> 01:02:10,450
But inadvertently, you get an idea that, okay, these people wear Jordans, so I'm a little.

945
01:02:10,710 --> 01:02:16,171
I should also look at the style, this designer is wearing it, this car is driving it,

946
01:02:16,251 --> 01:02:19,430
so you are wasting yourself to match them in vain.

947
01:02:19,510 --> 01:02:26,430
Yes, there is nothing wrong making friends from a class above if you are learning from them.

948
01:02:26,510 --> 01:02:28,810
If your business is friends and you think that you are learning from them.

949
01:02:31,800 --> 01:02:40,720
I have a friend who has 22 companies of landscaping in Oman and Dubai.

950
01:02:40,800 --> 01:02:42,720
Very good friend of mine.

951
01:02:42,800 --> 01:02:48,720
So I always aspire to him in the sense that he's a shrewd businessman.

952
01:02:48,800 --> 01:02:51,720
And I respect him a lot.

953
01:02:51,800 --> 01:02:54,720
When it comes to work, his body language changes.

954
01:02:54,800 --> 01:02:58,800
So I aspire that I should take work seriously.

955
01:02:59,110 --> 01:03:02,779
We are friends, but we had to do something together.

956
01:03:02,859 --> 01:03:04,975
He brought a folder and a pen.

957
01:03:05,055 --> 01:03:09,163
I said, we are not chilling here, we have to work.

958
01:03:09,243 --> 01:03:10,221
So I like that.

959
01:03:10,301 --> 01:03:12,427
This was years and years ago.

960
01:03:12,507 --> 01:03:19,015
So if you are learning good things from him, then it is good that your friend is rich,

961
01:03:19,095 --> 01:03:24,730
but if you are stuck in class war, look, it's good that you are not in class war.

962
01:03:24,810 --> 01:03:27,790
A good friend is someone who makes you feel inclusive.

963
01:03:27,870 --> 01:03:32,723
Someone who is mindful that, yes, he is my friend, he is a good friend,

964
01:03:32,803 --> 01:03:36,110
but I acknowledge that his car is not that good.

965
01:03:36,190 --> 01:03:38,857
Or where he works, there is not that much money,

966
01:03:38,937 --> 01:03:42,044
so we will not go to eat a steak for twenty thousand every day.

967
01:03:42,124 --> 01:03:43,950
We will sometimes eat some bun kebabs.

968
01:03:44,030 --> 01:03:47,490
Or then we will be mindful of the fact that he is struggling.

969
01:03:47,570 --> 01:03:50,370
For example, my very own friends from Dubai.

970
01:03:50,450 --> 01:03:53,370
Fahad Yasir, Badr, Hamza.

971
01:03:53,450 --> 01:03:56,370
They were my first friends and they were my friends in Dubai.

972
01:03:56,450 --> 01:04:00,370
So when I moved there, I was quite famous.

973
01:04:00,450 --> 01:04:03,370
So they took me around and everything.

974
01:04:03,450 --> 01:04:05,370
Then obviously they were there for 10 years.

975
01:04:05,450 --> 01:04:08,370
Their salaries were good, they had good cars. I didn't have a car.

976
01:04:08,450 --> 01:04:16,370
So I never felt that or it never happened that we didn't enjoy together.

977
01:04:16,450 --> 01:04:18,360
They always made sure that if we…

978
01:04:18,440 --> 01:04:25,860
Either we do something that is not too heavy for someone or we do something a little less than that.

979
01:04:25,940 --> 01:04:32,620
But never let me feel that their salary is in five figures and mine is in four thousand.

980
01:04:32,700 --> 01:04:35,620
Never. Whatever we did equally and together.

981
01:04:35,700 --> 01:04:37,620
These are the signs of good friends.

982
01:04:37,700 --> 01:04:44,340
They include you in their plans or mold you according to your needs and according to your outreach.

983
01:04:45,740 --> 01:04:49,357
So, if you have such friends, it's a good thing.

984
01:04:49,437 --> 01:04:53,662
For example, again, all of my friends went to Thailand.

985
01:04:53,742 --> 01:05:00,156
So I sold them the idea of Thailand, that this is a great place, this is in Phuket,

986
01:05:00,236 --> 01:05:04,762
this is in Bangkok, this is that, they were all charged up.

987
01:05:04,842 --> 01:05:09,059
And we decided that we would all go to Thailand.

988
01:05:09,139 --> 01:05:12,370
Then my sale was good, commissions were good.

989
01:05:12,450 --> 01:05:16,370
So I had two choices. Either I go to Thailand and spend the money.

990
01:05:16,450 --> 01:05:21,554
Or I give a down payment for the car.

991
01:05:21,634 --> 01:05:29,370
Because the car will elevate my outreach in terms of my work.

992
01:05:29,450 --> 01:05:35,370
I am a salesperson and a salesperson who has his own car and license gets a job like this in Dubai. Right?

993
01:05:35,450 --> 01:05:39,270
So I thought long term and then I excused him.

994
01:05:39,350 --> 01:05:44,470
I really wanted to go with you guys and I wanted to be your tour guide and show you all around.

995
01:05:44,550 --> 01:05:48,190
But you guys all are sorted, Mashallah, Mashallah, Allah gives more.

996
01:05:48,270 --> 01:05:50,450
But my goals and challenges are these.

997
01:05:50,530 --> 01:05:54,510
So I identified what is my long-term benefit.

998
01:05:54,590 --> 01:05:57,670
Thailand, Nana Plaza, everything will end in a week.

999
01:05:57,750 --> 01:06:00,150
But this car will go a long way.

1000
01:06:00,230 --> 01:06:03,390
So I kept my heart on the stone and said goodbye to them.

1001
01:06:03,470 --> 01:06:05,930
They kept sending me WhatsApp from there, now we are doing this and that.

1002
01:06:06,010 --> 01:06:11,450
It was fun. I was a little hurt that I was there. But then I saw a bigger picture.

1003
01:06:11,530 --> 01:06:14,418
So similarly, if you go abroad, you go with a goal.

1004
01:06:14,498 --> 01:06:16,480
If there is no generational wealth,

1005
01:06:16,560 --> 01:06:21,330
then the same goes for those who have to take care of their home and themselves.

1006
01:06:21,610 --> 01:06:29,250
So make sure you make like-minded friends or make sure that they are your friends who can acknowledge these things of yours.

1007
01:06:29,330 --> 01:06:31,090
Or they are strict too.

1008
01:06:31,170 --> 01:06:33,890
Those who are completely spoiled brats, not them.

1009
01:06:33,970 --> 01:06:38,307
The same Abhishek Upamaniuwala, when I was going to Mumbai for the first time,

1010
01:06:38,387 --> 01:06:42,161
I asked the girl in the flight, how will I go to South Mumbai?

1011
01:06:42,241 --> 01:06:44,450
She said, just get off the taxi and go.

1012
01:06:44,530 --> 01:06:49,570
Because she doesn't know that money is also something, everyone has money, right? It was a very good joke.

1013
01:06:49,960 --> 01:06:54,911
So the same spoiled brats, they have never seen any kind of trouble,

1014
01:06:54,991 --> 01:06:57,650
so they can't think of those things.

1015
01:06:57,770 --> 01:07:01,050
That this also happens that a person does not have money.

1016
01:07:01,130 --> 01:07:04,050
And not only that, no one has it at home.

1017
01:07:04,130 --> 01:07:07,050
So then you should check with your friends.

1018
01:07:07,130 --> 01:07:12,050
Or you can openly tell them that this is my budget and I have to live in this budget.

1019
01:07:12,130 --> 01:07:16,050
I really want to spend time with you guys and I enjoy your company and everything.

1020
01:07:16,130 --> 01:07:19,050
But I am not avoiding you because I don't enjoy.

1021
01:07:19,130 --> 01:07:22,050
I am doing it because the ones who enjoy don't have money.

1022
01:07:22,130 --> 01:07:28,540
Now, it's not that you are saying from the standpoint of asking, that you guys should take my expenses. Why should they take my expenses?

1023
01:07:28,620 --> 01:07:32,280
Yes, they are very good friends, so I will say it once, twice, and the third time.

1024
01:07:32,360 --> 01:07:35,360
They will also say that why should we give him money?

1025
01:07:36,060 --> 01:07:37,700
Don't lose your self-respect, but communicate straight up.

1026
01:07:37,780 --> 01:07:44,100
But let's communicate that I have this problem and I have to send home and I don't have much money.

1027
01:07:44,180 --> 01:07:47,200
So rather than hanging out 4 times a month, I'll do it once.

1028
01:07:47,280 --> 01:07:48,605
I would value it just as much.

1029
01:07:48,685 --> 01:07:52,465
But my constraints are that if they are good friends, they will understand you.

1030
01:07:52,545 --> 01:07:55,622
If they don't understand and still think you are making excuses,

1031
01:07:55,702 --> 01:07:56,002
they are not good friends.

1032
01:07:56,082 --> 01:08:04,720
They're not good friends, they're not acknowledging your weaknesses or your helplessness.

1033
01:08:04,800 --> 01:08:11,720
So if a friend doesn't understand your good and bad, difficult, easy time, then he's not a friend.

1034
01:08:11,800 --> 01:08:14,720
Then they're just passing time with you, then you don't need such friends in life.

1035
01:08:14,800 --> 01:08:21,720
So take it and stay on the means.

1036
01:08:21,800 --> 01:08:23,670
And rich friends, unless you are.

1037
01:08:23,750 --> 01:08:27,670
You are deriving good value, value not in terms of money but in terms of knowledge.

1038
01:08:27,750 --> 01:08:35,670
And if he is that kind of friend, the rich family never cares about the rich family.

1039
01:08:35,750 --> 01:08:38,670
They always talk in a down-to-earth way.

1040
01:08:38,750 --> 01:08:40,670
There is another example of this.

1041
01:08:40,750 --> 01:08:42,670
I was on a flight.

1042
01:08:42,750 --> 01:08:48,670
One gentleman, his family are one of very few families who run Pakistan. Right?

1043
01:08:48,750 --> 01:08:50,410
His surname is very…

1044
01:08:50,490 --> 01:08:56,130
But like so, people were meeting me on the flight, he didn't know me.

1045
01:08:56,210 --> 01:08:58,130
The same scene with Ratan Tata and Amitabh.

1046
01:08:58,210 --> 01:09:04,610
He asked me, are you an actor? I said no, I'm a YouTuber, I do podcasts, I talk about these social issues, etc.

1047
01:09:05,120 --> 01:09:05,725
I said okay.

1048
01:09:05,805 --> 01:09:10,221
He got up his seat, he could have told me his name, he got up from his seat,

1049
01:09:10,301 --> 01:09:14,007
he opened the compartment, overhead cabin,

1050
01:09:14,087 --> 01:09:18,070
and took out his laptop card from his laptop bag and gave it to me.

1051
01:09:18,150 --> 01:09:24,890
He gave me his card with respect. Whenever you give a visiting card, always take it with both hands and read it for 2 seconds.

1052
01:09:24,970 --> 01:09:30,870
Even if you're not reading it, but for 2 seconds, you'll acknowledge what's good and then you keep it in your respectable pocket.

1053
01:09:30,950 --> 01:09:37,310
Don't turn it around and put it in your wallet. Put it in your jacket or your breast pocket.

1054
01:09:37,390 --> 01:09:40,530
Put it in your pocket. All mannerisms are basic.

1055
01:09:40,610 --> 01:09:44,890
He gave me his card and when I read his name, I got scared.

1056
01:09:46,220 --> 01:09:49,140
You guys fucking run Pakistan man.

1057
01:09:49,220 --> 01:09:51,140
So, humbleness. Right?

1058
01:09:51,220 --> 01:09:54,140
The family man will always bow down and meet you.

1059
01:09:54,220 --> 01:09:57,140
He will make you feel so important that you can't think.

1060
01:09:57,220 --> 01:10:03,140
Similarly, I was with my former editor. The day before we were hanging out.

1061
01:10:03,220 --> 01:10:05,140
Who went to the US with me.

1062
01:10:05,220 --> 01:10:10,140
So, when I had him meet my ex-neighbor, who is now, Mashallah, a billionaire.

1063
01:10:10,220 --> 01:10:11,990
So he was telling me this, Minaj.

1064
01:10:12,070 --> 01:10:24,590
He acknowledged me and hugged me and said that he was very happy to meet me.

1065
01:10:24,670 --> 01:10:30,350
He said that I am nothing and I can't tell you what that man is like.

1066
01:10:30,430 --> 01:10:35,930
So this is the sign of a family man. They acknowledge you.

1067
01:10:36,010 --> 01:10:38,010
And a person needs acknowledgement.

1068
01:10:39,570 --> 01:10:41,490
I don't want to abuse you for 5 months. You won't like 10,000.

1069
01:10:41,570 --> 01:10:43,490
Respect and acknowledgement.

1070
01:10:43,570 --> 01:10:45,490
So, have respectable friends.

1071
01:10:45,570 --> 01:10:47,490
There's no harm in making rich friends.

1072
01:10:47,570 --> 01:10:51,490
But when they come to your parties, then it becomes very difficult for you to match up.

1073
01:10:51,570 --> 01:10:55,490
Then you go on your own route and you chase them.

1074
01:10:55,570 --> 01:10:59,490
Then you also forget your own path.

1075
01:10:59,570 --> 01:11:02,732
So yes, I wish you well.

1076
01:11:02,812 --> 01:11:07,330
Otherwise, I hope your means get better.

1077
01:11:07,410 --> 01:11:10,130
and you don't have these problems in the future.

1078
01:11:10,210 --> 01:11:12,130
Alright, there's another email.

1079
01:11:12,210 --> 01:11:15,130
Bhai, what's the scene with Naam Nahi Lete Hum?

1080
01:11:15,210 --> 01:11:17,630
When I say it often, I don't say it in the videos.

1081
01:11:17,710 --> 01:11:19,130
This is also from India.

1082
01:11:19,210 --> 01:11:22,130
Yes, Bhai, hi, Junaid Bhai, how are you?

1083
01:11:22,210 --> 01:11:26,630
I am ABC from Delhi and I've been binge watching your videos as usual.

1084
01:11:26,710 --> 01:11:31,630
First off, love your content, especially the way you handle controversial topics with a blend of humor and insight.

1085
01:11:31,710 --> 01:11:33,130
But I didn't understand one thing.

1086
01:11:33,210 --> 01:11:35,350
Every time you or other Pakistani talk about anything.

1087
01:11:35,430 --> 01:11:39,550
anything slightly controversial, there's this whole naam nahi lete hum wala wahi.

1088
01:11:39,630 --> 01:11:43,790
Like, chaliye naam nahi lete aur naam lena munasib nahi hai.

1089
01:11:43,870 --> 01:11:48,190
Bro, I get it when it's about serious political stuff. Pakistan ka scene waisa hai.

1090
01:11:48,500 --> 01:11:50,231
But what about regular things?

1091
01:11:50,311 --> 01:11:55,470
Like in your last video, you called out a comedian for his sexist comedy and rightly so.

1092
01:11:55,550 --> 01:12:01,070
But you were kinda hesitant to name him directly. Abhi bhi main naam nahi liya, inhone likha ho hai.

1093
01:12:01,150 --> 01:12:02,850
Even when people talk about cricketers.

1094
01:12:02,930 --> 01:12:06,530
or coaches who are clearly bad apples, you guys avoid taking names.

1095
01:12:06,610 --> 01:12:09,730
Meaning, is this the Voldemort scene?

1096
01:12:09,810 --> 01:12:14,730
You people, seriously, every person, what is the need to make the man who must not be named?

1097
01:12:14,810 --> 01:12:18,650
Now I understand that freedom issues aren't just limited to Pakistan.

1098
01:12:18,730 --> 01:12:22,210
These problems have been happening in India lately.

1099
01:12:22,290 --> 01:12:26,210
But even then, we openly say, whether it's Narendra Modi or Mukesh Ambani,

1100
01:12:26,290 --> 01:12:29,210
whether it's Avita Bachchan or whether it's Karan Johar,

1101
01:12:29,290 --> 01:12:30,970
we say it with our name.

1102
01:12:31,050 --> 01:12:34,261
straight forward and I'm not talking about average people.

1103
01:12:34,341 --> 01:12:46,369
Most YouTubers or any person on the internet or any celebrity for that matter is very vocal about calling out bullshit of any name regardless of whatever their the person in question holds any influence or not.

1104
01:12:46,449 --> 01:12:49,273
Diplomacy is one side but wherever it shouldn't be,

1105
01:12:49,353 --> 01:12:58,710
why do you have this hesitation even for small things like it's not even fair half the time it feels more like an ingrained habit of being too timid to call someone out.

1106
01:12:58,790 --> 01:13:02,390
I'm not putting you on the spot, but countless times I have seen you address people as,

1107
01:13:02,470 --> 01:13:04,790
You all know those YouTubers.

1108
01:13:04,870 --> 01:13:07,750
There's a minister from Punjab, you all know him.

1109
01:13:07,830 --> 01:13:10,390
There's an actor who does a lot of female dramas.

1110
01:13:10,470 --> 01:13:11,830
At some point, blah blah blah.

1111
01:13:11,910 --> 01:13:14,950
The comedian's name is written, what harm does he do to you?

1112
01:13:15,030 --> 01:13:18,550
You call him out without hesitation.

1113
01:13:18,630 --> 01:13:20,790
Big brother, just curious to hear your thoughts.

1114
01:13:20,870 --> 01:13:23,110
Maybe there is some deeper reason I'm missing.

1115
01:13:23,190 --> 01:13:24,720
But a typical Delhi home.

1116
01:13:24,800 --> 01:13:26,720
I am used to speaking straight.

1117
01:13:26,800 --> 01:13:30,720
Now, I consider you a big brother, so I am asking you.

1118
01:13:30,800 --> 01:13:35,720
What is the reason for not taking this name?

1119
01:13:35,800 --> 01:13:39,720
Thank you for your time and waiting to hear your thoughts.

1120
01:13:39,800 --> 01:13:41,720
Keep up the swag. Thank you.

1121
01:13:41,800 --> 01:13:44,720
Alright, very different question and a very good question.

1122
01:13:44,800 --> 01:13:45,720
He is a brother from Delhi.

1123
01:13:45,800 --> 01:13:52,800
And he noticed one thing among Pakistani YouTubers that…

1124
01:13:53,280 --> 01:13:56,020
Those who must not be named.

1125
01:13:56,100 --> 01:14:01,220
They noticed that we don't take names, you must know.

1126
01:14:01,560 --> 01:14:09,211
So they want to know that in India we openly call Modi, Karan Johar, Nebuchadnezzar,

1127
01:14:09,291 --> 01:14:11,340
why not in Pakistan?

1128
01:14:11,420 --> 01:14:13,820
So again it's a subjective matter.

1129
01:14:13,900 --> 01:14:16,620
Why doesn't anyone else do it, that's a different thing.

1130
01:14:16,700 --> 01:14:20,300
There are different things in this.

1131
01:14:20,660 --> 01:14:25,180
Now, I have shared the incident of the comedian.

1132
01:14:25,260 --> 01:14:28,980
Now, I don't because, look, out of respect, there is also something.

1133
01:14:29,060 --> 01:14:32,524
Now, I completely acknowledge that I may not agree with their content,

1134
01:14:32,604 --> 01:14:36,980
